              <div class="proc-title">Parts, Spares &amp; After-Sales</div>
              <div class="proc-desc">Because we manufacture the equipment, we stock the parts. Long-term support backed by the same team that built your machine.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="partner-strip">
          <span class="label">Manufacturing partner</span>
          <a href="https://akshayvipra.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AkshayVipra El-Mec Pvt. Ltd. ↗</a>
        </div>
